      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While people can cease to impact the world, their inherent existence and presence carry a unique, indispensable value that no professional metric can quantify. The idea of self-termination is not a logical solution to a situation where your current purpose has disappeared; rather, it is a sign that your definition of worth has become dangerously tied solely to external utility. Please consider speaking with a medical professional who understands this specific form of burnout, as it requires support you do not yet have to break down these logical traps that feel like a life sentence.",
